{"id":"de8dd45007d1","html":"<div><div><p>You are here: <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Blog</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/category/miscellany/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Miscellany</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> Are we a teardown or a fixer-upper?</p><div><p><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1e494b05-dd32-44ac-958c-4ed62f162618_1440x1797-600x749.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"749\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Last week’s newsletter began:</p>\n<blockquote><p>An out-of-town developer <a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/2023/02/27/normal-is-what-you-can-successfully-ignore/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">tore a house down</a> at the end of my street and cut down every single tree on the lot. As I watched the big T-Rex excavator claw down the walls, a thought ran through my head: <em>If it can be built, it can be torn down. </em>True of houses, relationships, and <a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/2025/09/03/fear-and-something/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">civilizations</a>. What got me the most was the <em>smell </em>of the big pile of demolished house. A smell of rot and death. And then the <a href=\"https://txmg.org/hendersonmg/plant-library/lily-oxblood-schoolhouse-lily/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">oxblood</a> and <a href=\"https://www.kut.org/energy-environment/2023-10-12/heres-why-austin-is-suddenly-covered-in-little-white-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">rain lilies</a> came up.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/bdd26d55-5c03-4c30-9fb1-999e0e532bd8_2048x2048-2-600x600.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Related: “<a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/2023/02/27/normal-is-what-you-can-successfully-ignore/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Normal is what you can successfully ignore</a>”</p>\n</div></div><p>This site participates in the Amazon Affiliates program, the proceeds of which keep it free for anyone to read.</p></div>"}